  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Contact</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Contact</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">Talk to a person, not a ticket queue.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Four routes, depending on what you need. Editorial and support go to humans who can actually change the outcome.</p>\n        \n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"grid g-4\">\n    <article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17.5 9 11l4 4 8-8.5\"/><path d=\"M21 6.5v5h-5\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Sales and demos</h3>\n      <p>Volume pricing, agency workspaces, enterprise scoping and demos. Response within one business day.</p>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:hello@presscosmos.com\">hello@presscosmos.com <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Editorial desk</h3>\n      <p>Submission questions, corrections, retractions and embargo coordination.</p>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:newsroom@presscosmos.com\">newsroom@presscosmos.com <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5.5\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"m3.8 7.2 8.2 5.6 8.2-5.6\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Customer support</h3>\n      <p>Account access, billing, reporting and technical issues.</p>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:support@presscosmos.com\">support@presscosmos.com <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M5.5 11.5a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0M12 18v3M9 21h6\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3>Journalist enquiries</h3>\n      <p>Media assets, executive interviews, data requests and comment.</p>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"journalists.html\">For journalists <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"split mt-4\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n    <form class=\"panel panel-glass\" data-form=\"contact\" novalidate style=\"padding:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">Send us a message</h2>\n      <div class=\"form-grid mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"c-name\">Name</label><input class=\"input\" id=\"c-name\" name=\"name\" required autocomplete=\"name\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"c-email\">Email</label><input class=\"input\" id=\"c-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"c-org\">Organisation</label><input class=\"input\" id=\"c-org\" name=\"organisation\" autocomplete=\"organization\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"c-topic\">Topic</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"c-topic\" name=\"topic\" required>\n            <option>Pricing or a quote</option><option>Agency workspace</option><option>Enterprise or SSO</option>\n            <option>Editorial or a correction</option><option>Technical support</option><option>Partnership</option><option>Something else</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field span-2\"><label for=\"c-message\">Message</label><textarea class=\"textarea\" id=\"c-message\" name=\"message\" required minlength=\"20\" placeholder=\"Tell us what you are trying to do. If it is about a release, include the headline.\"></textarea></div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn mt-3\" type=\"submit\">Send message <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n      <p class=\"form-status\" data-form-status aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"--flow:1rem\">\n      <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.5rem\">\n        <h3>Head office</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted mt-2\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">PressCosmos Media Network<br>2261 Market Street, Suite 4800<br>San Francisco, CA 94114<br>US</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-3\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\"><a href=\"tel:+14155550142\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">+1 (415) 555-0142</a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.5rem\">\n        <h3>Editorial hours</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted mt-2\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Monday to Friday, 06:00–22:00 UTC. Crisis lane: 24 hours, every day, for Newsmaker and Studio customers.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.5rem\">\n        <h3>Careers</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted mt-2\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">We hire editors and engineers. <a href=\"careers.html\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">See open roles</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Not sure which service you need?</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Describe the announcement. We will tell you which lanes we would run and what it would cost — including when the answer is fewer lanes than you expected.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"how-it-works.html\">How it works</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.7
}
